          "path": "_m/u/9/j/k/chernobyl-nuclear-power-plant-wp/chernobyl-journalists.jpg",
          "filename": "Chernobyl-journalists.JPG",
          "caption": "In april 2008 CRDP organised a press-trip for international journalists. TV Poland, Interviews Ukraine and Deuche-Welle TV, Norwegian Broadcasting corporation and The Sankei Shimbun (Japan) visited UNDP CRDP office, Chernobyl exclusion zone, Korosten Community Develoment Centre, Korosten local authorities Korosten city and Lugyny Youth Centre. The goal of the press-tour was to provide journalists with information about the current state of Chernobyl-affected areas and about UNNP-CRDP activities. As outcomes of the press-tour 3 TV programmes and one track were produced and one article was published.",
          "alt": "In april 2008 CRDP organised a press-trip for international journalists. TV Poland, Interviews Ukraine and Deuche-Welle TV, Norwegian Broadcasting corporation and The Sankei Shimbun (Japan) visited UNDP CRDP office, Chernobyl exclusion zone, Korosten Community Develoment Centre, Korosten local authorities Korosten city and Lugyny Youth Centre. The goal of the press-tour was to provide journalists with information about the current state of Chernobyl-affected areas and about UNNP-CRDP activities. As outcomes of the press-tour 3 TV programmes and one track were produced and one article was published.",
